  "把两个品种的优点直接拼合": "To join the good points of two varieties directly",
  "用高产感病（AAbb）和低产抗病（aaBB）的纯种杂交，F1 自交得 {0} 株 F2，理论上高产抗病（A_B_）的约有多少株？": "Pure lines of high-yield, susceptible (AAbb) and low-yield, resistant (aaBB) plants are crossed and the F1 self-pollinates, giving {0} F2 plants. In theory about how many are high-yield and resistant (A_B_)?",
  "F2 的四种表现型比例约为 9 : 3 : 3 : 1。": "The four phenotypes of the F2 are in a ratio of about 9 : 3 : 3 : 1.",
  "同样的杂交，{0} 株 F2 中，理论上高产抗病且能稳定遗传的纯合子（AABB）约有多少株？": "Same cross: of {0} F2 plants, in theory about how many are high-yield, resistant homozygotes (AABB) that breed true?",
  "AABB 占 F2 的 1/16；高产抗病的其他植株自交后代还会出现性状分离。": "AABB makes up 1/16 of the F2; the offspring of the other high-yield, resistant plants would still segregate.",
  "杂交育种、诱变育种、转基因技术和克隆技术是常见的育种与生物技术。": "Cross breeding, mutation breeding, transgenic technology and cloning are common breeding methods and biotechnologies.",
  "多莉羊（克隆羊）的遗传物质主要来自：": "The genetic material of Dolly the sheep (the cloned sheep) comes mainly from:",
  "代孕母羊": "The surrogate mother sheep",
  "三只羊各占三分之一": "One third from each of the three sheep",
  "细胞核是遗传的控制中心，克隆个体的性状与供核个体基本相同。": "The nucleus is the control centre of heredity, so a clone has almost the same traits as the nucleus donor.",
  "育种就是利用遗传和变异的原理培育新品种。": "Breeding uses the principles of heredity and variation to produce new varieties.",
  "数水蚤的心跳：10 s 内数到 {0} 次，每分钟约跳多少次？": "Counting the heartbeats of a water flea: you count {0} beats in 10 s. About how many beats per minute is that?",
  "每分钟的心跳次数 = 10 s 的次数 × 6。": "Beats per minute = beats in 10 s × 6.",
  "清水中水蚤 10 s 心跳 {0} 次，在某浓度的酒精中心跳 {1} 次，心率比清水中减少了百分之几？": "In clear water a water flea has {0} heartbeats in 10 s; in alcohol of a certain concentration it has {1}. By what percentage is the heart rate lower than in clear water?",
  "减少的百分数 = (清水中的次数 − 酒精中的次数) ÷ 清水中的次数 × 100 %。": "Decrease in percent = (count in clear water − count in alcohol) ÷ count in clear water × 100 %.",
  "同一只水蚤三次计数的结果分别是 {0}、{1}、{2} 次（每次 10 s），平均每 10 s 心跳多少次？": "Three counts of the same water flea give {0}, {1} and {2} beats (10 s each). What is the average number of beats per 10 s?",
  "重复计数取平均值，可以减小误差。": "Repeating the count and taking the average reduces the error.",
  "本实验中，在清水里观察水蚤的心率，其作用是：": "In this experiment, observing the heart rate of the water flea in clear water serves to:",
  "作对照，与酒精中的心率比较": "Act as a control, to compare with the heart rate in alcohol",
