  "对照实验中，只有酒精的浓度这一个条件不同。": "In a controlled experiment only one condition, the alcohol concentration, is different.",
  "酒精浓度较高（如 20 %）时，水蚤的心率会：": "At a high alcohol concentration (such as 20 %) the heart rate of the water flea will:",
