  "下列属于非生物因素的是：": "Which of the following is an abiotic factor?",
  "生态系统中，影响生物生活的环境因素分为非生物因素（光、温度、水、空气、土壤等）和生物因素（其他生物）。": "In an ecosystem the environmental factors that affect organisms are divided into abiotic factors (light, temperature, water, air, soil and so on) and biotic factors (other organisms).",
  "“{0}”描述的是哪种生态系统？": "“{0}” describes which ecosystem?",
  "{0}生态系统": "{0} ecosystem",
  "常见的生态系统有森林、草原、湿地、海洋、农田和城市生态系统。": "Common ecosystems are forest, grassland, wetland, ocean, farmland and urban ecosystems.",
  "在本模型中，一个生态系统能承受并恢复的最大干扰是 80 × 物种数 ÷ (物种数 + 8) %。物种数为 {0} 时，约是多少？": "In this model the largest disturbance an ecosystem can bear and recover from is 80 × number of species ÷ (number of species + 8) %. With {0} species, about how much is it?",
  "物种越多，生态系统的自我调节能力越强，越稳定。": "The more species there are, the stronger the self-regulation of an ecosystem and the more stable it is.",
  "探究“光对鼠妇分布的影响”时，除光以外的其他条件（温度、湿度等）应该：": "When investigating “the effect of light on the distribution of woodlice”, apart from light all the other conditions (temperature, humidity and so on) should be:",
