  "Q = c × m × ΔT。": "Q = c × m × ΔT.",
  "水吸收的热量为 {0} J，这些热量来自 {1} g 食物的燃烧，测得每克食物含能量多少千焦？": "The water absorbs {0} J of heat, which came from burning {1} g of food. How many kilojoules per gram of food does this measure?",
  "每克食物的能量 = Q ÷ 食物的质量，再把焦耳换成千焦。": "Energy per gram of food = Q ÷ mass of the food, then change joules to kilojoules.",
  "{0} g 的水吸收了 {1} J 的热量，水温升高多少摄氏度？（水的比热容 4.2 J/(g·℃)）": "{0} g of water absorbs {1} J of heat. By how many degrees Celsius does its temperature rise? (specific heat of water 4.2 J/(g·℃))",
