  "每 {0} 人中有 1 位某隐性遗传病基因的携带者。夫妻{1}时，孩子患这种病的概率是每一万个孩子中约多少个？（携带者之间的孩子患病概率为 1/4）": "1 person in {0} carries the gene of a certain recessive genetic disease. When the couple is {1}, about how many in every ten thousand children have this disease? (the chance that a child of two carriers is affected is 1/4)",
