  "这样的器官叫同源器官，是比较解剖学提供的进化证据。": "Such organs are called homologous organs; they are evidence for evolution from comparative anatomy.",
  "各种脊椎动物（鱼、龟、鸡、人）的早期胚胎都有鳃裂和尾，这说明：": "The early embryos of all vertebrates (fish, turtle, chicken, human) have gill slits and a tail, which shows that:",
