  "胚胎早期相似，越到后期差异越大，是胚胎学提供的进化证据。": "Embryos look alike early on and become more different later; this is evidence for evolution from embryology.",
  "细胞色素 c 有 104 个氨基酸。{0}与人的有 {1} 个氨基酸不同，两者相同的氨基酸约占多少？（拓展内容）": "Cytochrome c has 104 amino acids. That of {0} differs from the human one in {1} amino acids. About what percentage of the amino acids are the same? (extension)",
  "差异越小，说明亲缘关系越近。": "The smaller the difference, the closer the relationship.",
  "在进化树中，{0}与{1}的最近共同祖先大约生活在多少百万年前？（教学用的约数）": "In the evolutionary tree, about how many million years ago did the most recent common ancestor of {0} and {1} live? (rounded teaching values)",
  "两条谱系分开得越晚，亲缘关系越近。": "The later two lineages split, the closer the relationship.",
  "下列生物中，细胞色素 c 的氨基酸序列与人的差异最小、亲缘关系最近的是：（拓展内容）": "Which of these organisms has a cytochrome c amino-acid sequence that differs least from the human one and is therefore the closest relative? (extension)",
