  "菌落数 ÷ 涂布体积 × 稀释倍数 = 每毫升原菌液的细菌数。": "Colonies ÷ volume spread × dilution factor = bacteria per millilitre of the original suspension.",
  "把 1 mL 菌液加入 9 mL 无菌水（稀释 10 倍），这样连续稀释 {0} 次，总稀释倍数是：": "1 mL of suspension is added to 9 mL of sterile water (a 10-fold dilution) and this is repeated {0} times in a row. The total dilution factor is:",
