  "开始时耐药菌占 {0} ‰，每次用药杀死 {1} % 的敏感菌，存活的细菌再繁殖回到原来的总数。连续用药 {2} 次后，耐药菌约占多少？": "At the start {0} ‰ of the bacteria are resistant. Each treatment kills {1} % of the susceptible bacteria, and the survivors multiply back to the original total. After {2} treatments in a row, about what share is resistant?",
  "用药把敏感菌清除，耐药菌因此在群体中的比例越来越大。": "The treatment removes the susceptible bacteria, so the share of resistant bacteria in the population keeps growing.",
