  "种皮保护种子；胚由胚根、胚轴、胚芽和子叶组成，是新植物的幼体。": "The seed coat protects the seed; the embryo is made of radicle, hypocotyl, plumule and cotyledons and is the young of the new plant.",
  "玉米种子储存营养物质的结构是：": "The structure that stores the nutrients of a maize seed is:",
  "玉米是单子叶植物，营养储存在胚乳中；菜豆是双子叶植物，营养储存在子叶中。": "Maize is a monocotyledon and stores its food in the endosperm; the bean is a dicotyledon and stores it in the cotyledons.",
  "在玉米种子的纵切面上滴一滴碘液，变成蓝色的部分是：": "When a drop of iodine is put on a lengthwise section of a maize seed, the part that turns blue is:",
  "淀粉遇碘变蓝，胚乳中含有大量淀粉。": "Starch turns blue with iodine, and the endosperm contains a lot of starch.",
  "测定种子的萌发率：每组 {0} 粒，共 3 组，萌发的种子分别为 {1} 粒、{2} 粒、{3} 粒。平均萌发率是多少？": "Measuring the germination rate: {0} seeds per group, 3 groups; {1}, {2} and {3} seeds germinated. What is the average germination rate?",
  "平均萌发率 = 三组萌发的种子总数 ÷ 种子总数 × 100 %。": "Average germination rate = total of the germinated seeds of the three groups ÷ total number of seeds × 100 %.",
  "测定种子的萌发率时，为了减小误差，应该：": "To reduce the error when measuring the germination rate of seeds, you should:",
  "每组取数量较多的种子，并重复做几组取平均值": "Take a large number of seeds per group and repeat for several groups, then average",
