  "种子表面必须有水膜": "the seed must have a film of water on its surface",
  "还要有适宜的外界条件：温度、水分、空气。": "Suitable external conditions are also needed: temperature, water and air.",
  "种子萌发时，最先突破种皮的结构是：": "When a seed germinates, the structure that first breaks through the seed coat is the:",
  "胚根": "radicle",
  "胚芽": "plumule",
  "子叶": "cotyledon",
  "胚轴": "hypocotyl",
  "种皮": "seed coat",
  "胚根发育成根，胚芽发育成茎和叶。": "The radicle develops into the root, and the plumule develops into the stem and leaves.",
  "某蛾类深色型占 {0}%。污染程度 s = {1}，捕食压力 e = {2}。按模型 深色型存活率 = 1 − e(0.8 − 0.6s)，浅色型存活率 = 1 − e(0.2 + 0.6s)，下一代深色型占多少？（%）": "In a species of moth the dark form makes up {0}%. The degree of pollution is s = {1} and the predation pressure is e = {2}. By the model, survival of the dark form = 1 − e(0.8 − 0.6s) and survival of the light form = 1 − e(0.2 + 0.6s). What percentage of the next generation is the dark form? (%)",
  "下一代比例 = p·wD /(p·wD + (1−p)·wL)。": "Proportion in the next generation = p·wD /(p·wD + (1−p)·wL).",
  "捕食压力 e = {0}，树皮的污染程度 s = {1}。按模型，深色型的存活率（%）是多少？（存活率 = 1 − e(0.8 − 0.6s)）": "The predation pressure is e = {0} and the degree of pollution of the bark is s = {1}. According to the model, what is the survival rate of the dark form (%)? (Survival = 1 − e(0.8 − 0.6s))",
  "树皮越黑，深色蛾越不容易被发现。": "The blacker the bark, the less easily dark moths are seen.",
  "起初深色型占 {0}%，e = {1}，s = {2}。深色型的比例超过 50% 至少需要几代？": "At the start the dark form is {0}%, e = {1} and s = {2}. At least how many generations are needed for the dark form to exceed 50%?",
  "代": "generations",
  "逐代按模型计算。": "Calculate generation by generation with the model.",
  "桦尺蛾在污染的环境中深色型增多，说明：": "That dark forms of the peppered moth increase in a polluted environment shows that:",
  "环境对生物的变异起选择作用，适者生存": "the environment selects among the variations of organisms, and the fittest survive",
  "环境使浅色蛾突然变黑": "the environment suddenly turns light moths black",
  "深色蛾故意躲避捕食者": "dark moths deliberately avoid predators",
  "所有蛾都发生了相同的变异": "all the moths underwent the same variation",
  "浅色蛾全部迁出了该地区": "all the light moths moved out of the area",
  "变异是不定向的，自然选择是定向的。": "Variation is not directed, natural selection is directed.",
  "如果没有捕食者（e = 0），两种体色蛾的比例会：": "If there are no predators (e = 0), the proportion of the two colour forms of the moth will:",
  "保持不变": "stay the same",
  "浅色型增多": "the light form will increase",
  "深色型增多": "the dark form will increase",
  "深色型消失": "the dark form will disappear",
  "两种体色都消失": "both forms will disappear",
  "没有选择压力，比例不变（本模型不含迁入、迁出与随机变化）。": "With no selection pressure the proportion does not change (this model has no immigration, emigration or random change).",
  "按模型，皮肤向外散失的热量 = 8 ×（1 − 0.1 × 衣服层数）×（34 − 气温）W。气温 {0} °C，穿 {1} 层衣服时约散失多少 W？": "According to the model, the heat lost from the skin to the outside = 8 × (1 − 0.1 × layers of clothes) × (34 − air temperature) W. At an air temperature of {0} °C and with {1} layers of clothes, about how many W are lost?",
  "气温越低、衣服越少，散热越多。": "The lower the air temperature and the fewer the clothes, the more heat is lost.",
  "产热 {0} W（{1}），气温 {2} °C，不穿多余衣服（0 层）。蒸发每毫升汗水带走 2.43 kJ。每小时至少要排汗约多少毫升？": "Heat production is {0} W ({1}), the air temperature is {2} °C, and no extra clothes are worn (0 layers). Each millilitre of sweat that evaporates carries away 2.43 kJ. At least about how many millilitres of sweat must be produced every hour?",
  "排汗量 =（产热 − 皮肤散热）× 3600 / 2430。": "Amount of sweat = (heat production − heat loss through the skin) × 3600 / 2430.",
  "{0}时产热约 {1} W。一小时产生多少千焦的热量？（1 W = 1 J/s）": "When {0}, heat production is about {1} W. How many kilojoules of heat are produced in an hour? (1 W = 1 J/s)",
  "热量 = 功率 × 时间。": "Heat = power × time.",
  "天气炎热时，人体维持体温恒定的主要方式是：": "When the weather is hot, the main way the human body keeps its temperature constant is:",
  "皮肤血管舒张、汗液蒸发散热": "the blood vessels of the skin dilate and the evaporation of sweat carries heat away",
  "皮肤血管收缩、减少排汗": "the blood vessels of the skin contract and sweating is reduced",
  "战栗产热": "shivering produces heat",
  "停止呼吸": "stopping breathing",
  "减少饮水": "drinking less",
  "汗液蒸发要吸收热量。": "The evaporation of sweat absorbs heat.",
  "皮肤的功能不包括：": "The functions of the skin do NOT include:",
  "进行光合作用": "carrying out photosynthesis",
  "保护身体": "protecting the body",
  "排出汗液": "discharging sweat",
