  "皮肤由表皮、真皮和皮下组织构成。": "The skin consists of the epidermis, the dermis and the subcutaneous tissue.",
  "空气温度 {0} °C 时饱和水汽压为 0.611 × exp(17.27T/(T+237.3)) kPa。相对湿度 {1}% 时，空气的饱和差（饱和水汽压 × (1 − 相对湿度)）是多少？": "At an air temperature of {0} °C the saturation vapour pressure is 0.611 × exp(17.27T/(T+237.3)) kPa. At a relative humidity of {1}%, what is the saturation deficit of the air (saturation vapour pressure × (1 − relative humidity))?",
  "空气越干燥，饱和差越大，蒸腾越强。": "The drier the air, the greater the saturation deficit and the stronger the transpiration.",
  "叶面积 {0} cm²、气孔开度 {1}%、饱和差 {2} kPa、风速 {3} m/s。按模型 失水量 = 0.5 × (叶面积/100) × 开度 × 饱和差 × (1 + 0.12 × 风速)，每小时失水多少克？": "Leaf area {0} cm², stomatal opening {1}%, saturation deficit {2} kPa, wind speed {3} m/s. By the model, water loss = 0.5 × (leaf area/100) × opening × saturation deficit × (1 + 0.12 × wind speed). How many grams of water are lost per hour?",
  "其他条件不变，失水量与叶面积成正比。": "With the other conditions unchanged, water loss is proportional to leaf area.",
  "其他条件不变，叶面积增大到原来的 {0} 倍，蒸腾失水量是原来的几倍？": "With the other conditions unchanged, the leaf area becomes {0} times as great. How many times as great is the water lost by transpiration?",
  "失水量与叶面积成正比。": "Water loss is proportional to leaf area.",
  "气孔张开时，保卫细胞的状态是：": "When the stomata are open, the state of the guard cells is:",
  "吸水膨胀": "they have taken up water and swollen",
  "失水收缩": "they have lost water and shrunk",
  "细胞死亡": "the cells are dead",
  "细胞壁消失": "the cell wall has disappeared",
  "保卫细胞吸水膨胀，气孔张开；失水收缩，气孔关闭。": "The guard cells take up water and swell, and the stomata open; they lose water and shrink, and the stomata close.",
  "植物体内的水分主要以水蒸气的形式通过哪个结构散失到空气中？": "Through which structure is the water in a plant mainly lost to the air as water vapour?",
  "导管": "vessel",
  "筛管": "sieve tube",
  "根毛": "root hair",
  "气孔是植物蒸腾失水的“门户”，也是气体交换的“窗口”。": "The stomata are the “gateways” of a plant's loss of water by transpiration and also the “windows” for gas exchange.",
  "人体血液约占体重的 7.5 %（约 75 mL/kg）。体重 {0} kg 的人血液约有多少升？": "Human blood makes up about 7.5 % of body weight (about 75 mL/kg). About how many litres of blood does a person of body weight {0} kg have?",
  "血量 = 体重 × 75 mL/kg。": "Blood volume = body weight × 75 mL/kg.",
  "体重 {0} kg，血细胞容积（红细胞等占血液的体积百分比）为 {1} %，血浆约有多少升？（血量 75 mL/kg）": "Body weight {0} kg, packed cell volume (the percentage of the blood volume taken up by red cells and so on) {1} %. About how many litres of plasma are there? (Blood volume 75 mL/kg)",
  "血浆 = 血量 ×（1 − 血细胞容积比）。": "Plasma = blood volume × (1 − packed cell volume fraction).",
  "每搏输出量 70 mL，心率 {0} 次/分钟；{1}的总横截面积约 {2} cm²。血流速度 = 流量 / 横截面积，约是多少厘米每秒？": "The stroke volume is 70 mL and the heart rate {0} beats/minute; the total cross-sectional area of the {1} is about {2} cm². Blood speed = flow / cross-sectional area. About how many centimetres a second is it?",
  "总横截面积越大，血流越慢。": "The greater the total cross-sectional area, the slower the blood flows.",
  "四肢的静脉内有瓣膜，作用是：": "The veins of the limbs have valves; their function is to:",
  "防止血液倒流": "prevent the blood flowing back",
  "增加血压": "increase blood pressure",
  "增加血流速度": "increase the speed of blood flow",
  "运输氧气": "carry oxygen",
  "动脉和毛细血管没有瓣膜。": "Arteries and capillaries have no valves.",
  "{0}（{1}）时，应在伤口的哪里按压止血？": "For {0} ({1}), where should pressure be applied to stop the bleeding?",
  "伤口正上方用力揉": "rub hard directly above the wound",
  "动脉血从心脏流向伤口，所以按压近心端；静脉血流回心脏，所以按压远心端。": "Arterial blood flows from the heart to the wound, so press on the end nearer the heart; venous blood flows back to the heart, so press on the end farther from the heart.",
