  "手的温度使管内气体受热膨胀，从导管口逸出，形成气泡。": "The warmth of the hand makes the gas in the tube expand and escape from the end of the tube, forming bubbles.",
  "用高锰酸钾制氧气时，试管口要放一团棉花，目的是": "When making oxygen from potassium permanganate, a wad of cotton wool is put at the mouth of the test tube in order to",
