  "先熄灭酒精灯，试管内气体收缩，水会倒吸使热的试管炸裂。": "If the lamp is put out first, the gas in the tube contracts and water is sucked back, cracking the hot tube.",
  "用排水法收集氧气，开始收集的适宜时刻是": "When collecting oxygen over water, the right moment to start collecting is",
  "导管口气泡连续、均匀冒出时": "when bubbles come out of the tube steadily and evenly",
