  "气泡停止时": "when the bubbles stop",
  "刚开始排出的是装置内的空气，要等气泡连续均匀冒出再收集，才能得到较纯的氧气。": "The first gas to come out is the air in the apparatus; wait until the bubbles are steady and even before collecting, to get fairly pure oxygen.",
  "向试管中倾倒液体药品时，瓶塞的放法是": "When pouring a liquid chemical into a test tube, the stopper of the bottle is put",
  "倒放在桌面上": "upside down on the bench",
