  "瓶塞倒放，防止污染药品；标签向着手心，防止残液腐蚀标签。": "The stopper is put upside down to avoid contaminating the chemical; the label faces the palm so that drips do not corrode it.",
  "取用液体药品，没有说明用量时，一般取": "When no quantity is stated for a liquid chemical, you generally take",
  "半试管": "half a test tube",
