  "氢气还原氧化铜的实验，正确的操作顺序是": "In the experiment of reducing copper(II) oxide with hydrogen, the correct order of operations is",
  "先通氢气，再加热；结束时先停止加热，继续通氢气至冷却": "pass hydrogen first, then heat; at the end stop heating first and keep passing hydrogen until cool",
