  "空气中含量最多的气体是": "The gas present in the greatest amount in air is",
  "按体积计，空气中氮气约占 78%，氧气约占 21%。": "By volume, air is about 78% nitrogen and 21% oxygen.",
  "按体积计，空气中氧气约占": "By volume, the proportion of oxygen in air is about",
  "氮气约占 78%，氧气约占 21%，稀有气体约占 0.94%，二氧化碳约占 0.03%。": "Nitrogen is about 78%, oxygen about 21%, noble gases about 0.94% and carbon dioxide about 0.03%.",
  "下列气体中，不属于空气污染物的是": "Of the following gases, the one that is not an air pollutant is",
  "二氧化碳是空气的成分之一，虽能引起温室效应，但不计入空气污染物。": "Carbon dioxide is one of the components of air; although it can cause the greenhouse effect, it is not counted as an air pollutant.",
  "氮气常用作食品包装中的保护气，是因为": "Nitrogen is often used as a protective gas in food packaging because it",
  "常温下化学性质不活泼": "is chemically unreactive at room temperature",
  "密度比空气小": "is less dense than air",
  "无色无味": "is colourless and odourless",
  "难溶于水": "is insoluble in water",
  "氮气化学性质不活泼，可以防止食品氧化变质。": "Nitrogen is chemically unreactive and can stop food being oxidised and going bad.",
  "干冰可用于人工降雨，是因为": "Dry ice can be used to make artificial rain because",
  "干冰升华时吸收大量的热": "dry ice absorbs a lot of heat when it sublimes",
  "干冰能溶于水": "dry ice dissolves in water",
  "干冰无毒": "dry ice is non-toxic",
