  "固态二氧化碳升华吸热，使水蒸气凝结成水滴。": "Solid carbon dioxide absorbs heat as it sublimes and makes water vapour condense into droplets.",
  "金刚石可用来切割玻璃，是因为金刚石": "Diamond can be used to cut glass because it",
  "硬度很大": "is very hard",
  "能导电": "conducts electricity",
  "透明": "is transparent",
  "密度大": "has a high density",
