  "是黑色的": "is black",
  "石墨具有良好的导电性，而且质软、有滑腻感，也可作润滑剂。": "Graphite conducts electricity well, and it is soft and feels slippery, so it can also be used as a lubricant.",
  "活性炭可用于净水，是因为它": "Activated carbon can be used to purify water because it",
  "具有疏松多孔的结构，能吸附色素和异味": "has a loose, porous structure and can adsorb colouring matter and odours",
  "可以燃烧": "can burn",
  "活性炭有很强的吸附性，但不能除去水中可溶性的钙、镁化合物。": "Activated carbon adsorbs strongly, but it cannot remove the soluble calcium and magnesium compounds from water.",
  "浓硫酸可用作干燥剂，是因为浓硫酸具有": "Concentrated sulfuric acid can be used as a drying agent because it has",
  "吸水性": "the property of absorbing water",
  "脱水性": "dehydrating power",
  "挥发性": "volatility",
  "氧化性": "oxidising power",
  "浓硫酸能吸收空气中和气体中的水蒸气；脱水性是使纸张、木材炭化。": "Concentrated sulfuric acid absorbs water vapour from air and gases; its dehydrating power is what chars paper and wood.",
  "浓盐酸敞口放置，质量会减小，是因为浓盐酸具有": "Concentrated hydrochloric acid left open loses mass because it has",
  "可燃性": "flammability",
  "不稳定性": "instability",
  "浓盐酸挥发出氯化氢气体，溶质质量减小；浓硫酸则因吸水使溶液质量增大。": "Concentrated hydrochloric acid gives off hydrogen chloride gas, so the mass of solute falls; concentrated sulfuric acid, by contrast, absorbs water and its solution gains mass.",
  "氢氧化钠固体敞口放置，会潮解并变质，变质是因为它吸收了空气中的": "Solid sodium hydroxide left open becomes damp and goes bad because it has absorbed from the air",
  "水蒸气和二氧化碳": "water vapour and carbon dioxide",
  "氢氧化钠易吸水潮解，又与二氧化碳反应生成碳酸钠，所以要密封保存。": "Sodium hydroxide readily absorbs water and deliquesces, and it also reacts with carbon dioxide to form sodium carbonate, so it must be kept sealed.",
  "氢氧化钠固体可以干燥的气体是": "A gas that solid sodium hydroxide can dry is",
  "氯化氢": "hydrogen chloride",
  "氢氧化钠能与二氧化碳、二氧化硫、氯化氢等气体反应，不能干燥它们。": "Sodium hydroxide reacts with gases such as carbon dioxide, sulfur dioxide and hydrogen chloride, so it cannot be used to dry them.",
  "熟石灰常用来改良酸性土壤，是因为熟石灰的水溶液": "Slaked lime is often used to improve acidic soil because its aqueous solution",
  "显碱性": "is alkaline",
  "显酸性": "is acidic",
