  "原子不显电性，所以核电荷数（质子数）等于核外电子数；中子数不一定等于质子数。": "An atom is electrically neutral, so the nuclear charge (number of protons) equals the number of electrons outside the nucleus; the number of neutrons need not equal the number of protons.",
  "相对原子质量约等于": "Relative atomic mass is approximately equal to the",
