  "分子是保持物质化学性质的最小粒子；原子是化学变化中的最小粒子。": "The molecule is the smallest particle that keeps the chemical properties of a substance; the atom is the smallest particle in a chemical change.",
  "在化学变化中，不能再分的粒子是": "In a chemical change, the particle that cannot be divided further is the",
