  "化学变化中分子分成原子，原子重新组合成新分子，原子本身不变。": "In a chemical change molecules split into atoms and the atoms regroup into new molecules; the atoms themselves do not change.",
  "氯化钠是由什么粒子构成的": "Sodium chloride is made up of which particles?",
