  "冰是水分子之间的间隔变化的结果，水分子本身没有改变，属于物理变化。": "Ice results from a change in the spacing between water molecules; the water molecules themselves do not change, so it is a physical change.",
  "精制食盐水时，Na2CO3 溶液必须在 BaCl2 溶液之后加入，原因是": "When refining brine, the Na2CO3 solution must be added after the BaCl2 solution, because",
