  "顺序没有影响": "the order makes no difference",
  "BaCl2 过量，多余的 Ba²⁺ 要靠后加入的 Na2CO3 生成 BaCO3 沉淀除去。": "BaCl2 is in excess, and the surplus Ba²⁺ must be removed as BaCO3 precipitate by the Na2CO3 added afterwards.",
  "粗盐提纯的实验中，蒸发时当蒸发皿中出现较多固体时应": "In the experiment on purifying crude salt, when a lot of solid appears in the evaporating dish during evaporation you should",
  "停止加热，利用余热蒸干": "stop heating and let the remaining heat dry it",
