  "倒掉剩余液体": "pour away the remaining liquid",
  "出现较多固体时停止加热，用余热使剩余水分蒸干，防止固体飞溅。": "When a lot of solid appears, stop heating and let the remaining heat evaporate the rest of the water, so that the solid does not spit out.",
  "从含 CuSO4 的废水中回收铜，加入过量铁粉后再加入过量稀硫酸的目的是": "In recovering copper from waste water containing CuSO4, excess iron powder is added and then excess dilute sulfuric acid. The purpose of the acid is",
  "除去过量的铁": "to remove the excess iron",
  "使铜溶解": "to dissolve the copper",
  "增加溶液的酸性": "to make the solution more acidic",
  "生成更多的铜": "to form more copper",
  "铁与稀硫酸反应而溶解，铜不反应，最后得到纯净的铜。": "Iron reacts with dilute sulfuric acid and dissolves, while copper does not react, so pure copper is finally obtained.",
  "流程图中“过滤”操作得到的滤渣是": "In a flowchart, the residue obtained from the “filtration” step is",
