  "过滤把不溶性固体与液体分离，留在滤纸上的是滤渣。": "Filtration separates an insoluble solid from a liquid; what stays on the filter paper is the residue.",
  "用作配制溶液和较大量试剂的反应容器，加热时要垫石棉网": "Used as a reaction vessel for preparing solutions and larger amounts of reagents; needs a wire gauze when heated",
