  "加热高锰酸钾制取氧气并用排水法收集，操作步骤的顺序是": "When oxygen is made by heating potassium permanganate and collected over water, the order of the steps is",
  "连接装置并检查气密性": "assemble the apparatus and check that it is gas-tight",
