  "在锥形瓶中加入二氧化锰": "put manganese dioxide into the conical flask",
  "从长颈漏斗中加入过氧化氢溶液": "add the hydrogen peroxide solution through the thistle funnel",
  "用排水法收集氧气": "collect the oxygen over water",
  "用带火星的木条检验氧气": "test for oxygen with a glowing splint",
  "用酚酞溶液检验氢氧化钠与盐酸恰好完全反应，操作顺序是": "The order of operations for using phenolphthalein solution to show that sodium hydroxide and hydrochloric acid have just reacted completely is",
  "向氢氧化钠溶液中滴入几滴酚酞溶液": "add a few drops of phenolphthalein solution to the sodium hydroxide solution",
  "观察到溶液变红": "observe that the solution turns red",
  "用胶头滴管逐滴加入稀盐酸并不断振荡": "add dilute hydrochloric acid drop by drop from a dropper, shaking all the time",
  "红色恰好消失时停止滴加": "stop adding when the red colour has just disappeared",
