  "置换反应：一种单质与一种化合物反应，生成另一种单质和另一种化合物。": "Displacement reaction: an element reacts with a compound and forms another element and another compound.",
  "复分解反应：两种化合物互相交换成分，生成另外两种化合物。": "Double displacement reaction: two compounds exchange components and form two other compounds.",
  "不属于四种基本反应类型，例如氧气与有机物的反应，或非金属氧化物与碱、一氧化碳与金属氧化物的反应。": "Not one of the four basic types, for example oxygen with an organic compound, a non-metal oxide with a base, or carbon monoxide with a metal oxide.",
