  "质量比等于（系数 × 相对分子质量）之比：": "The mass ratio equals the ratio of (coefficient × relative molecular mass):",
  "{0} g 溶质完全溶解在 {1} g 水中，所得溶液的溶质质量分数是多少（%）？": "{0} g of solute dissolves completely in {1} g of water. What is the mass fraction of the solute in the solution (%)?",
  "质量分数 = 溶质质量 ÷ 溶液质量 × 100%，溶液质量 = 溶质质量 + 溶剂质量：": "Mass fraction = mass of solute ÷ mass of solution × 100%; mass of solution = mass of solute + mass of solvent:",
