  "加入水的质量 / g": "Mass of water added / g",
  "把 {0} g 质量分数为 {1}% 的溶液稀释成质量分数为 {2}% 的溶液，需要加水多少 g？": "{0} g of a solution with a mass fraction of {1}% is diluted to {2}%. How many g of water must be added?",
  "稀释前后溶质的质量不变：": "The mass of solute does not change on dilution:",
  "{0} ℃时，下表中 {1} 的溶解度是多少（g / 100 g 水）？": "At {0} ℃, what is the solubility of {1} in the table (g / 100 g of water)?",
  "{0} ℃时 {1} 的溶解度是 {2} g：在该温度下，100 g 水中最多溶解 {3} g。": "At {0} ℃ the solubility of {1} is {2} g: at this temperature 100 g of water dissolves at most {3} g.",
  "饱和溶液，有固体剩余": "Saturated solution, some solid remains",
  "不饱和溶液": "Unsaturated solution",
  "{0} ℃时 {1} 的溶解度是 {2} g，100 g 水最多溶解 {3} g；加入 {4} g，超过了 {5} g，所以得到饱和溶液，有固体剩余。": "At {0} ℃ the solubility of {1} is {2} g, so 100 g of water dissolves at most {3} g; {4} g is added, which exceeds {5} g, so the solution is saturated and some solid remains.",
  "{0} ℃时 {1} 的溶解度是 {2} g，100 g 水最多溶解 {3} g；加入 {4} g，没有超过 {5} g，所以得到不饱和溶液。": "At {0} ℃ the solubility of {1} is {2} g, so 100 g of water dissolves at most {3} g; {4} g is added, which does not exceed {5} g, so the solution is unsaturated.",
  "{0} ℃时，把 {1} g {2} 加入 100 g 水中充分搅拌，得到的溶液是：": "At {0} ℃, {1} g of {2} is stirred into 100 g of water. The solution obtained is:",
