  "判断下面两种物质能否发生复分解反应（两种物质都在溶液中）：": "Decide whether these two substances undergo double displacement (both in solution):",
  "复分解反应的条件：生成物中有沉淀、气体或水，反应物要能溶于水（酸与不溶性碱或碳酸盐反应除外）。": "Condition for double displacement: the products include a precipitate, a gas or water, and the reactants must dissolve in water (except an acid reacting with an insoluble base or a carbonate).",
