  "纯净物分为单质和化合物；由两种元素组成、其中一种是氧的化合物是氧化物；酸、碱、盐是三类不同的化合物；混合物由多种物质组成。": "Pure substances are elements or compounds; an oxide is a compound of two elements, one of which is oxygen; acids, bases and salts are three kinds of compounds; a mixture consists of several substances.",
