  "的 pH 约为 {0}，它是：": "has a pH of about {0}. It is:",
  "pH < 7 显酸性，pH = 7 显中性，pH > 7 显碱性。pH 约为 {0}，所以显{1}。": "pH < 7 is acidic, pH = 7 is neutral, pH > 7 is alkaline. The pH is about {0}, so it is {1}.",
  "下列溶液中，酸性最强的是：": "Which of these solutions is the most acidic?",
  "下列溶液中，碱性最强的是：": "Which of these solutions is the most alkaline?",
  "pH 越小，酸性越强。": "The lower the pH, the stronger the acidity.",
  "pH 越大，碱性越强。": "The higher the pH, the stronger the alkalinity.",
  "下列溶液中，能使无色酚酞溶液变红的是：": "Which of these solutions turns colourless phenolphthalein red?",
  "无色酚酞溶液遇碱性溶液变红，遇酸性或中性溶液不变色。": "Colourless phenolphthalein turns red in an alkaline solution and stays colourless in an acidic or neutral one.",
  "向稀盐酸中不断滴加氢氧化钠溶液，溶液的 pH 变化是：": "Sodium hydroxide solution is added continuously to dilute hydrochloric acid. The pH:",
  "逐渐增大": "Increases gradually",
  "酸被中和，酸性减弱，pH 增大；恰好中和时 pH = 7，氢氧化钠过量后 pH 大于 7。": "The acid is neutralised, the acidity decreases and the pH rises; at exact neutralisation pH = 7, and with excess sodium hydroxide the pH is above 7.",
  "逐渐减小": "Decreases gradually",
  "不变": "Does not change",
  "先增大后减小": "Rises, then falls",
  "向氢氧化钠溶液中不断滴加稀盐酸，溶液的 pH 变化是：": "Dilute hydrochloric acid is added continuously to sodium hydroxide solution. The pH:",
