  "先减小后增大": "Falls, then rises",
  "向稀盐酸中加水稀释，溶液的 pH 变化是：": "Water is added to dilute hydrochloric acid. The pH:",
  "逐渐增大，但始终小于 7": "Increases gradually but always stays below 7",
  "酸性减弱，pH 增大，但稀释不能使酸变成碱，pH 只会无限接近 7。": "The acidity decreases and the pH rises, but dilution cannot turn an acid into a base: the pH only comes ever closer to 7.",
  "逐渐增大，最后大于 7": "Increases gradually and ends above 7",
  "向氢氧化钠溶液中加水稀释，溶液的 pH 变化是：": "Water is added to sodium hydroxide solution. The pH:",
  "逐渐减小，但始终大于 7": "Decreases gradually but always stays above 7",
  "碱性减弱，pH 减小，但稀释不能使碱变成酸，pH 只会无限接近 7。": "The alkalinity decreases and the pH falls, but dilution cannot turn a base into an acid: the pH only comes ever closer to 7.",
  "逐渐减小，最后小于 7": "Decreases gradually and ends below 7",
