  "行星和矮行星": "Planets and dwarf planets",
  "每次 10 题：认行星、认卫星、认星座、认月相，还有地球和宇宙的知识。没有时间限制，每题答完后有解释。": "10 questions each time: planets, moons, constellations, Moon phases, and facts about the Earth and the universe. There is no time limit, and every answer comes with an explanation.",
