  "从地球看": "Seen from the Earth",
  "农历{0}前后": "Lunar calendar day: around {0}",
  "月龄 {0} 天": "Moon age: {0} days",
  "被照亮的部分：{0}%": "Lit part: {0}%",
  "月球在地球和太阳之间，暗面朝向地球。": "The Moon is between the Earth and the Sun; its dark side faces the Earth.",
  "月亮正在变圆（盈），亮的一侧在右边。": "The Moon is waxing; the bright side is on the right.",
  "地球在月球和太阳之间，整个朝向地球的一面都被照亮。": "The Earth is between the Moon and the Sun; the whole side facing the Earth is lit.",
  "月亮正在变缺（亏），亮的一侧在左边。": "The Moon is waning; the bright side is on the left.",
  "新月": "New Moon",
  "上弦月": "First quarter",
  "满月": "Full Moon",
  "下弦月": "Last quarter",
  "播放一个月": "Play one month",
  "月球绕地球一圈约 29.5 天（农历的一个月）。月球自己不发光，总有一半被太阳照亮；我们看到的月相，是这被照亮的一半有多少朝向地球。": "The Moon goes round the Earth in about 29.5 days (one month of the lunar calendar). The Moon makes no light of its own; half of it is always lit by the Sun. The phase we see depends on how much of that lit half faces the Earth.",
  "约{0}": "about {0}",
  "八种月相": "The eight phases",
  "沿轨道的偏离（度）": "Offset along the orbit (degrees)",
  "离开地球轨道面的高度（度）": "Height above the Earth's orbit plane (degrees)",
  "太阳和月球的位置（从地球看）": "Sun and Moon (seen from the Earth)",
  "地球的影子和月球的位置": "The Earth's shadow and the Moon",
  "本影": "Umbra",
  "半影": "Penumbra",
  "太阳": "Sun",
  "侧面示意图（高度已放大）": "Side view (height exaggerated)",
  "没有日食": "No solar eclipse",
  "日偏食": "Partial solar eclipse",
  "日全食或日环食": "Total or annular solar eclipse",
  "没有月食": "No lunar eclipse",
  "半影月食": "Penumbral lunar eclipse",
  "月偏食": "Partial lunar eclipse",
  "月全食": "Total lunar eclipse",
  "月球与{0}的夹角：{1}°": "Angle between the Moon and {0}: {1}°",
  "地球的影子中心": "the centre of the Earth's shadow",
  "日食只发生在新月（农历初一）；月球的影子很小，只扫过地球上的一条窄带。": "A solar eclipse happens only at New Moon (day 1 of the lunar month); the Moon's shadow is small and sweeps only a narrow band of the Earth.",
  "月食只发生在满月（农历十五、十六）；整个夜晚半球的人都能看到。": "A lunar eclipse happens only at Full Moon (day 15 or 16 of the lunar month); everyone on the night side can see it.",
  "日食": "Solar eclipse",
  "月食": "Lunar eclipse",
  "每个月都有一次新月和一次满月，为什么不是每个月都有日食和月食？因为月球的轨道和地球绕太阳的轨道平面相差约 5°，大多数时候月球从太阳（或地球的影子）的上方或下方经过。": "There is a New Moon and a Full Moon every month. Why is there not an eclipse every month? The Moon's orbit is tilted by about 5° from the plane of the Earth's orbit, so most of the time the Moon passes above or below the Sun (or the Earth's shadow).",
  "春季": "Spring",
  "夏季": "Summer",
  "秋季": "Autumn",
  "冬季": "Winter",
  "日期（一年中的第几天）": "Date (day of the year)",
  "太阳直射点": "Sun overhead",
  "北极": "North Pole",
  "地轴倾斜 23.4°，方向不变": "The axis is tilted 23.4° and keeps its direction",
  "地球公转（从北极上方看）": "The Earth's orbit (seen from above the North Pole)",
  "正午太阳高度 {0}°": "Noon Sun height: {0}°",
  "白昼 {0} 小时": "Daylight: {0} hours",
  "北半球": "northern hemisphere",
  "太阳直射纬度：{0}°": "Latitude of the overhead Sun: {0}°",
  "日地距离：{0} 百万千米": "Earth-Sun distance: {0} million km",
  "北京": "Beijing",
  "悉尼": "Sydney",
  "四季的原因是地轴倾斜，不是离太阳的远近：1 月初地球离太阳最近，北半球却是冬天。": "The seasons are caused by the tilt of the Earth's axis, not by the distance to the Sun: in early January the Earth is closest to the Sun, yet it is winter in the northern hemisphere.",
  "地球一边自转，一边绕太阳公转，地轴始终指向同一个方向（北极星附近）。太阳光直射的位置因此在南北回归线之间来回移动。": "The Earth spins and goes round the Sun at the same time, and its axis always points in the same direction (near the Pole Star). The place where the Sun is overhead therefore moves back and forth between the Tropics.",
  "高潮": "High tide",
  "海水的隆起（已放大）": "The bulges of the sea (exaggerated)",
  "两天内的潮汐（小时）": "Tides over two days (hours)",
  "潮汐强度：{0} ×": "Tide strength: {0} ×",
  "月相：{0}": "Moon phase: {0}",
  "月球和太阳的引力把海水拉起来，每天约涨落两次，间隔约 12 小时 25 分。新月和满月时太阳、地球、月球在一条直线上，潮最大（大潮，农历初一、十五前后）；上弦和下弦时最小（小潮）。": "The pull of the Moon and the Sun raises the sea, which rises and falls about twice a day, every 12 hours 25 minutes. At New Moon and Full Moon the Sun, Earth and Moon are in line and the tide is biggest (spring tide, around day 1 and 15 of the lunar month); at the quarters it is smallest (neap tide).",
  "海水为什么会涨落？移动月球，看看潮的大小怎样变化。": "Why does the sea rise and fall? Move the Moon and see how the size of the tide changes.",
  "已过的天数": "Days passed",
  "第 {0} 天": "Day {0}",
  "公转：{0}° （{1} 圈）": "Orbit: {0}° ({1} turns)",
  "自转：{0} 圈": "Spin: {0} turns",
  "地球绕太阳转一圈约 365.24 天，这段时间里自转约 366.24 圈，比昼夜的次数多一圈。红点是地面上的一个标记。": "The Earth goes round the Sun in about 365.24 days and spins about 366.24 times in that time, one more than the number of days and nights. The red dot is a mark on the ground.",
