  "轨道间距为示意，公转周期保持真实比例；最快的卫星约 4 秒转一圈。": "Orbit spacing is schematic; the orbital periods keep their true proportions. The fastest moon goes round in about 4 seconds.",
  "这里只列出著名的卫星；{0} 共有已确认的卫星约 {1} 颗。": "Only the famous moons are listed here; {0} has about {1} confirmed moons in all.",
