  "体重计": "Weight scale",
  "你的体重（千克）": "Your weight (kg)",
  "体重 = 质量 × 当地重力。质量不变，重力不同，称出的数字就不同。气态行星按 1 个大气压处计算。": "Weight = mass × local gravity. The mass stays the same, but gravity differs, so the number on the scale differs. For gas planets the value at 1 atmosphere is used.",
  "年龄计": "Age counter",
  "你的年龄（岁）": "Your age (years)",
  "一年就是绕太阳转一圈：离太阳越远，一年越长，同样的时间里年龄的数字就越小。": "A year is one trip round the Sun: the farther from the Sun, the longer the year, and the smaller the number for the same time.",
  "和地球比大小": "Size compared with the Earth",
