  "量筒的读数 V": "Cylinder reading V",
  "固体：选择铜块、正确的顺序、体积不小于 10 cm³，测得的密度与 8.9 g/cm³ 相差不超过 5 %": "Solid: choose the copper block and the correct order, with a volume of at least 10 cm³; the measured density differs from 8.9 g/cm³ by no more than 5 %.",
  "固体：选择错误的顺序（先测体积、后测质量），使测得的密度比真实值大 2 % 以上": "Solid: choose the wrong order (volume first, mass afterwards) so that the measured density is more than 2 % above the true value.",
  "液体：选择酒精、正确的顺序，测得的密度与 0.8 g/cm³ 相差不超过 5 %": "Liquid: choose alcohol and the correct order; the measured density differs from 0.8 g/cm³ by no more than 5 %.",
  "固体：选择石蜡块，观察它的密度小于水，放入水中会漂浮": "Solid: choose the paraffin wax block and observe that its density is lower than that of water, so it floats in water.",
